5. SDK Automation for Static Website Hosting

Execution Steps
1.Create S3 bucket
2.Enable static website hosting
3.Install boto3 library
4.Write Python upload script
5.Upload website files automatically
6.Open website endpoint URL

Project Overview
Automated static website hosting on Amazon S3 using Python and boto3.

AWS Services Used
Amazon S3
boto3 SDK

Features
Automated website upload
Static website hosting
Reduced manual configuration

Architecture
Python Script → S3 Bucket → Static Website
